[
  {
    "title": "Algorithms, Variables & Sequence",
    "tag": "LESSON 03",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 1 · From a purpose to a program",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Algorithms,<br>Variables &amp; Sequence</h1><p class=\"zh\">算法 · 变量 · 顺序执行</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Predict → trace → run → modify</p>",
    "note": "本课把前两课的数据表示、程序目的与输入输出连起来，第一次系统追踪顺序程序。告诉学生今天会真正修改一个票价计算器，但先用纸笔预测，再使用运行工具。课程采用 AP 伪代码，目的是理解程序执行，不要求安装编程环境。暂不进入条件、循环、列表或自定义过程。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Bring two ideas forward",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL · ORIGINAL PRACTICE",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "DAT-1.C.a · CRD-2.C / CRD-2.D",
    "html": "<p><strong>A.</strong> Decode the binary integer <span class=\"mono\">001010</span>.</p><p><strong>B.</strong> A ticket app receives a ticket count and shows a total price. Identify its input and output.</p><details><summary>Show answers</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>A: 8 + 2 = <strong>10</strong>.</p><p>B: Input = ticket count. Output = calculated total price.</p></div></details><p class=\"small\">Today: describe the steps between input and output.</p>",
    "note": "先给一分钟独立写答案，再同桌各解释一项。二进制题回收第一课；输入输出题回收第二课。若学生把按钮或屏幕当作唯一答案，追问程序实际收到、送出的数据是什么。不要把复习扩展成重新讲完整二进制转换；用 8 和 2 的位权快速核对后进入算法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Learning goals",
    "tag": "LEARNING GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.A / B · AAP-2.A / B / C",
    "html": "<ol><li>Write clear, ordered steps for a task.</li><li>Explain how assignment changes a variable.</li><li>Trace values and evaluate expressions.</li><li>Predict, run and modify a short program.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Success: explain <em>why</em> a program displays a value.</p><p class=\"small zh\">不只报答案：说明当前值、执行顺序与计算依据。</p>",
    "note": "让学生圈出自己最不确定的一项。强调正确输出只是证据的一部分，能够解释每一步的当前值才表明真正理解。今天涉及多个官方主题的入门部分，不能把这一课说成完整的算法与编程单元。"
  },
  {
    "title": "From purpose to an algorithm",
    "tag": "DESIGN THE STEPS",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.A.1–3 · Skill 2.A",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Purpose: help a buyer find the cost of tickets.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A three-step algorithm receives a ticket count, calculates count times price, then displays the total. Each result feeds the next step.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 210\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"24\" width=\"330\" height=\"160\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"59\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#d3ad62\">1</text><text x=\"169\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Receive</text><text x=\"169\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">ticket count</text><rect x=\"434\" y=\"24\" width=\"330\" height=\"160\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"466\" y=\"59\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#d3ad62\">2</text><text x=\"599\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Calculate</text><text x=\"599\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count × price</text><rect x=\"864\" y=\"24\" width=\"330\" height=\"160\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"896\" y=\"59\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#d3ad62\">3</text><text x=\"1029\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Display</text><text x=\"1029\" y=\"143\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">calculated total</text><path d=\"M345 108H404\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M402 101L416 108L402 115Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><path d=\"M775 108H834\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M832 101L846 108L832 115Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/></svg></figure><p>An <strong>algorithm</strong> specifies a finite set of instructions for a task.</p><p class=\"small\">The same algorithm can be expressed in everyday language, a diagram or pseudocode.</p>",
    "note": "先区分为什么做与怎样做：帮助买家确定费用是目的；读数量、相乘、显示是步骤。算法可以先用自然语言设计，并不要求一开始就写代码。强调有限且清楚可执行的步骤；“计算正确答案”过于含糊，必须说明怎样计算。此页的指令范围只涉及顺序执行，后续课程才系统展开选择和迭代。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Sequence makes the steps usable",
    "tag": "SEQUENCING",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.B.1–2 / B.6 · Skill 2.A",
    "html": "<p>Put these instructions into a useful order:</p><div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>A.</strong> Display the total.</p><p><strong>B.</strong> Receive the ticket count.</p><p><strong>C.</strong> Calculate count × 12.</p></div><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>B → C → A.</strong> The calculation needs the input; displaying the result needs the calculation.</div></details><p class=\"small zh\">Sequence：按指令给出的顺序执行。</p>",
    "note": "让学生用依赖关系解释顺序，不只背 BCA。追问如果尚未得到输入就先计算，使用的是什么值；本题没有给默认值，不能擅自设成零。说明顺序不是随意排版，后面的步骤常依赖前面已经产生的值。也不要教成任何两行代码交换都会出错；稍后比较具体例子。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Give a value a meaningful name",
    "tag": "VARIABLES",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.A.1–2 · Skill 3.A",
    "html": "<p>A <strong>variable</strong> gives a stored value a name.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two independent named storage cards. The variable tickets currently holds 3, and price currently holds 12.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 258\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"10\" width=\"520\" height=\"195\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"10\" width=\"520\" height=\"57\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\">tickets</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"64\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">3</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">current value</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">number of tickets</text><rect x=\"650\" y=\"10\" width=\"520\" height=\"195\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"650\" y=\"10\" width=\"520\" height=\"57\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#193148\" stroke=\"#193148\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"910\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"31\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\">price</text><text x=\"910\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"64\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">12</text><text x=\"910\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">current value</text><text x=\"910\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">price per ticket</text></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\">Meaningful names explain what the values represent.</p><p class=\"small\"><span class=\"mono\">tickets ← 3</span> and <span class=\"mono\">price ← 12</span> establish these current values.</p>",
    "note": "用标签和当前值的图示即可，不必过度类比会自动联动的数学函数。一个变量在某一时刻代表一个值；之后赋值可改变它。变量也能表示其他数据类型或集合，但本课只用数字，不能因此说所有变量都只能装一个数字。让学生解释 tickets 与 price 的含义，并提出一个更清楚的票数变量名。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Read assignment from right to left",
    "tag": "ASSIGNMENT · 赋值",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B.1–3 · Skill 4.B",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\">score ← 7\nscore ← score + 2</pre><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Assignment first reads score as 7, evaluates 7 plus 2, and then stores the result in score. The final stored value is left as a question for prediction.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 183\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"8\" width=\"325\" height=\"163\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"167\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">1 · Read current score</text><text x=\"167\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"49\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">7</text><rect x=\"435\" y=\"8\" width=\"325\" height=\"163\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"597\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">2 · Evaluate the right side</text><text x=\"597\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"49\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">7 + 2</text><rect x=\"865\" y=\"8\" width=\"325\" height=\"163\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1027\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3 · Store in score</text><text x=\"1027\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"49\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">?</text><path d=\"M345 91H408\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M406 84L420 91L406 98Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><path d=\"M775 91H838\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M836 84L850 91L836 98Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/></svg></figure><details><summary>Show the final value</summary><div class=\"answer\"><span class=\"mono\">score</span> now holds <strong>9</strong>. Evaluate the right side first, then replace the old value on the left.</div></details>",
    "note": "第二行是今天的关键句，带学生说完整过程：先取旧的 score 值 7，加 2 得 9，再写回 score。箭头表示赋值方向，不是数学恒等式。允许学生画旧值划掉、新值写入的记录。不要说电脑同时保留 7 和 9 在这个数字变量里；追踪表保留历史是为了供人分析。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Assignment copies the current value",
    "tag": "COMMON MISCONCEPTION",
    "time": "24–29 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B.2–3 · Skill 4.B",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:26px;line-height:1.4;padding:18px;margin:12px 0\">a ← 6\nb ← a\na ← 9\nDISPLAY(b)</pre><div><p>Predict the output.</p><p>Does changing <span class=\"mono\">a</span> also change <span class=\"mono\">b</span>?</p><p class=\"small\">Trace the assignment target on each line.</p></div></div><details><summary>Show answer and value states</summary><div class=\"answer\"><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"After b is assigned a, both variables contain 6. After a is assigned 9, b still contains the copied value 6.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 140\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"550\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"642\" y=\"8\" width=\"550\" height=\"120\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"283\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After b ← a</text><text x=\"283\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">a: 6       b: 6</text><text x=\"917\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After a ← 9</text><text x=\"917\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">a: 9       b: 6</text><path d=\"M574 67H616\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M614 60L628 67L614 74Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/></svg></figure><p><strong>6.</strong> Assignment copied a number; it did not create a live link.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "先让学生投票 6 或 9，再要求每个人用一行一个状态记录。第二行执行时 a 为 6，所以复制的是当时的值 6。第三行只有 a 位于赋值左边，因此 b 不变。本课只讨论简单数值，不扩展其他语言的引用语义。DISPLAY 是显示当前表达式值，后续会正式说明输入输出语法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Assignment is different from equality",
    "tag": "READ THE SYMBOL",
    "time": "29–33 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B · AAP-2.E.2 preview",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Assignment x gets x plus one changes a stored 4 into 5. Equality x equals 4 compares the current value without changing the variable.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 260\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"5\" width=\"560\" height=\"244\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"636\" y=\"5\" width=\"560\" height=\"244\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"284\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">ASSIGNMENT</text><text x=\"916\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">EQUALITY COMPARISON</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"33\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">x ← x + 1</text><text x=\"916\" y=\"88\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"33\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">x = 4</text><rect x=\"36\" y=\"115\" width=\"185\" height=\"66\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">x: 4</text><path d=\"M237 148H310\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M308 141L322 148L308 155Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"337\" y=\"115\" width=\"185\" height=\"66\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#225a83\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"429\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\">x: 5</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#225a83\">writes a new value</text><rect x=\"668\" y=\"115\" width=\"185\" height=\"66\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">x: 4</text><path d=\"M868 148H942\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M940 141L954 148L940 155Z\" fill=\"#28766f\"/><rect x=\"970\" y=\"115\" width=\"185\" height=\"66\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1062\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">match?</text><text x=\"916\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">reads x; does not update it</text></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\">In AP pseudocode, use <span class=\"mono\">←</span> to store a value and <span class=\"mono\">=</span> to compare values.</p><p class=\"small\">Comparisons and decisions receive a full lesson later.</p>",
    "note": "用 AP 参考语言准确区分箭头和等号。此处只为阻断把 x←x+1 当成不可能方程的错误；不进入布尔运算、条件语句或真假表。不要引入其他语言使用 = 或 == 的规则，避免学生混用。告诉学生本章运行工具接受箭头和便于键盘输入的 <-，等号不是该工具的赋值符号。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An expression produces one value",
    "tag": "ARITHMETIC",
    "time": "33–37 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.B.3–5 · AAP-2.C.1 / C.3–4",
    "html": "<p>Use the usual mathematical order of operations.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two calculation paths. Without parentheses, first multiply 3 by 4, then add 2. With parentheses, first add 2 and 3, then multiply by 4.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 248\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"278\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">2 + 3 * 4</text><text x=\"922\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">(2 + 3) * 4</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1 · Evaluate</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2 · Combine</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"100\" width=\"220\" height=\"82\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3 × 4 = 12</text><path d=\"M242 141H257\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M255 134L269 141L255 148Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"280\" y=\"100\" width=\"220\" height=\"82\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">2 + 12 = 14</text><text x=\"255\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">multiplication first</text><text x=\"764\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1 · Evaluate</text><text x=\"1034\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2 · Combine</text><rect x=\"654\" y=\"100\" width=\"220\" height=\"82\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"764\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">2 + 3 = 5</text><path d=\"M886 141H901\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M899 134L913 141L899 148Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"924\" y=\"100\" width=\"220\" height=\"82\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1034\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">5 × 4 = 20</text><text x=\"899\" y=\"228\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">parentheses first</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\"><span class=\"mono\">+</span> add · <span class=\"mono\">−</span> subtract · <span class=\"mono\">*</span> multiply · <span class=\"mono\">/</span> divide</p><p class=\"small\">Division is not automatically integer division: <span class=\"mono\">8 / 5</span> gives <strong>1.6</strong>.</p>",
    "note": "先计算乘法例，再用括号改变顺序；强调表达式最终求得一个值，赋值才把值写进变量。书写程序代码时使用 ASCII 减号 -，屏幕普通文字中的减号只是排版。解释 AP 伪代码除法保留小数结果，不因为操作数是整数就自动截断。本课不教 MOD，也不考它；后续算术主题补齐。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Substitute first, then calculate",
    "tag": "INDEPENDENT PRACTICE · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "37–41 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.C · Skill 4.B",
    "html": "<p>Assume <span class=\"mono\">count = 3</span> and <span class=\"mono\">price = 12</span>.</p><p><strong>A.</strong> <span class=\"mono\">count * price + 3</span></p><p><strong>B.</strong> <span class=\"mono\">count * (price + 3)</span></p><p><strong>C.</strong> Explain why the results differ.</p><details><summary>Show answers</summary><div class=\"answer\"><p>A: 3 × 12 + 3 = <strong>39</strong>. B: 3 × 15 = <strong>45</strong>.</p><p>A adds 3 once. B adds 3 to the price of each of three tickets.</p></div></details>",
    "note": "这里等号用于说明当前数值，不是要求学生用等号写赋值代码。先各自计算，再把两个式子解释成一次收费与每张票收费。这个语义差别会在修改任务中再次出现。若学生两式都算成 45，要求先圈出乘法范围；若只会计算不会解释，引导把 3×(12+3) 展开成三份 12 加三份 3。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A trace records the state after each step",
    "tag": "WORKED TRACE",
    "time": "41–45 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B · AAP-2.B.6 · Skill 4.B",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\"><div><pre class=\"code\">a ← 5\nb ← a + 2\na ← a * 2\nDISPLAY(b)</pre></div><div><table><thead><tr><th>After line</th><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>5</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>5</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>10</td><td>7</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"small\">— means not assigned yet; it does not mean zero.</p></div></div><details><summary>Show output</summary><div class=\"answer\">The fourth line displays <strong>7</strong>. Displaying a value does not change either variable.</div></details>",
    "note": "示范每执行一行才写下一行状态，不要先凭最后一行倒推。第 2 行 b=7，随后第 3 行 a=10 而 b 仍是 7。用破折号标记尚未赋值，避免学生默认初始化为零。DISPLAY 只产生输出，在此例不修改 a、b。邀请一名学生完整口述第 3 行的旧值、表达式结果、新值。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A four-line ticket calculator",
    "tag": "INPUT → PROCESS → OUTPUT",
    "time": "45–49 min",
    "code": "AAP-3.A.6 / A.9 · CRD-2.C / D",
    "html": "<div class=\"visual-row\"><pre class=\"code\">tickets ← INPUT()\nprice ← 12\ntotal ← tickets * price\nDISPLAY(total)</pre><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ticket count enters through INPUT, processing multiplies it by the fixed price 12, and DISPLAY sends out the calculated total.\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 280\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15\" y=\"4\" width=\"530\" height=\"71\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">INPUT</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">ticket count</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"101\" width=\"530\" height=\"71\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">PROCESS</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count × 12</text><rect x=\"15\" y=\"198\" width=\"530\" height=\"71\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">OUTPUT</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">calculated total</text><path d=\"M280 79V88\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M273 86L280 98L287 86Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><path d=\"M280 176V185\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M273 183L280 195L287 183Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/></svg></figure></div><p><span class=\"mono\">INPUT()</span> returns the supplied value; <span class=\"mono\">DISPLAY(total)</span> outputs the current total.</p><p class=\"small\">Requirement: an integer ticket count from <strong>1 to 50</strong>, at 12 per ticket. No booking fee yet.</p>",
    "note": "把四行对应输入、固定价格、处理和输出。INPUT 的结果必须被接收，本例赋给 tickets；12 来自代码，并不是运行时用户输入。明确输入范围 1 到 50 是本活动前提，程序此时并没有检查或拒绝其他值，不能声称已经实现验证。AP 的 DISPLAY 按参考表显示表达式值后跟一个空格，纸面答案通常只写显示值。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Trace one complete run",
    "tag": "WORKED EXAMPLE · INPUT 3",
    "time": "49–53 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B · Skill 4.B",
    "html": "<p>The next input value is <strong>3</strong>. Read each snapshot <em>after</em> its statement executes.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Four program states: tickets is set to 3; price is set to 12; total becomes 36; DISPLAY outputs 36 without changing the stored variables.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 295\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"38\" width=\"270\" height=\"245\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">1 · INPUT</text><text x=\"27\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">tickets</text><text x=\"229\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">3</text><text x=\"27\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">price</text><text x=\"229\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">—</text><text x=\"27\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total</text><text x=\"229\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">—</text><path d=\"M23 209H257\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Output: —</text><path d=\"M283 159H290\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M288 152L302 159L288 166Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"309\" y=\"38\" width=\"270\" height=\"245\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"444\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">2 · price ← 12</text><text x=\"331\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">tickets</text><text x=\"533\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">3</text><text x=\"331\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">price</text><text x=\"533\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">12</text><text x=\"331\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total</text><text x=\"533\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">—</text><path d=\"M327 209H561\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"444\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Output: —</text><path d=\"M587 159H594\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M592 152L606 159L592 166Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"613\" y=\"38\" width=\"270\" height=\"245\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"748\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3 · calculate</text><text x=\"635\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">tickets</text><text x=\"837\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">3</text><text x=\"635\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">price</text><text x=\"837\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">12</text><text x=\"635\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total</text><text x=\"837\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">36</text><path d=\"M631 209H865\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"748\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Output: —</text><path d=\"M891 159H898\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M896 152L910 159L896 166Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"917\" y=\"38\" width=\"270\" height=\"245\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1052\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">4 · DISPLAY</text><text x=\"939\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">tickets</text><text x=\"1141\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">3</text><text x=\"939\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">price</text><text x=\"1141\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#225a83\">12</text><text x=\"939\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">total</text><text x=\"1141\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"30\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">36</text><path d=\"M935 209H1169\" stroke=\"#d3ad62\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"1052\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#28766f\">Output: 36</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">— means not yet assigned or no output yet. DISPLAY does not change the stored values.</p>",
    "note": "先遮住后两行让学生填，再核对完整追踪。每行都表示该语句执行后的状态：前三行尚未输出任何内容，不能把 tickets 的输入 3 当成程序输出。第 4 行显示 36，但变量 total 依然为 36。强调一次运行和下一次运行是分开的；新运行重新执行输入语句。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Predict three runs before opening the lab",
    "tag": "PREDICT · ORIGINAL PRACTICE",
    "time": "53–57 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.B · CRD-2.J.1 / J.3",
    "html": "<p>The four-line program charges <strong>12 per ticket</strong>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Ticket input</th><th>Your expected total</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>________</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>________</td></tr><tr><td>50</td><td>________</td></tr></tbody></table><details><summary>Show expected outputs</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>12, 24, 600</strong>, in three separate runs.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Record an expected result before comparing it with actual output.</p>",
    "note": "用 1、2、50 分别覆盖最小合法值、小的内部值和最大合法值。要求写预期值后才能打开运行工具，否则只是观察而不是检验预测。三次运行各只提供一个输入，不把 1、2、50 误当成一次程序会处理的三张订单；该程序只调用一次 INPUT。所有题目原创，不宣称是考试真题。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Run it, one statement at a time",
    "tag": "PROGRAMMING LAB",
    "time": "57–62 min",
    "code": "Predict → Step → Compare → Reset",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_1_Programming_Lab.html\" target=\"_blank\">Open the Chapter 1 programming lab ↗</a></p><ol><li>Enter the four-line ticket program and input <strong>2</strong>.</li><li>Step through it; compare the trace with your prediction.</li><li>Reset and run again with input <strong>50</strong>.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Use a numeric input queue: each <span class=\"mono\">INPUT()</span> takes the next value.</p><p class=\"small\">Teaching subset: numeric assignment, arithmetic, INPUT and DISPLAY. No IF, loops or user-defined procedures.</p>",
    "note": "教师先演示输入 2 的逐步运行，再让学生两人一组操作，预测者和操作者交换角色。输入队列允许逗号分隔多个数，但本程序每次只消耗一个；重置后应核对队列。工具支持箭头或 <-、数值运算与括号，也支持 DISPLAY 中的带引号文字，变量名区分大小写。它不是完整的 AP 语言解释器；不支持条件、循环、列表、自定义过程或等式比较。网络不便时使用下载包中的同名 HTML，或纸笔追踪作为替代。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Changing the order can change the result",
    "tag": "COMPARE TWO SEQUENCES",
    "time": "62–66 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.B.6 · AAP-2.L.2 introduction",
    "html": "<div class=\"columns\"><div><h3>Program A</h3><pre class=\"code\">price ← 12\ntotal ← 2 * price\nprice ← 10\nDISPLAY(total)</pre></div><div><h3>Program B</h3><pre class=\"code\">price ← 12\nprice ← 10\ntotal ← 2 * price\nDISPLAY(total)</pre></div></div><details><summary>Show outputs and explanation</summary><div class=\"answer\">A displays <strong>24</strong>; B displays <strong>20</strong>. Each total uses the price value at the moment its assignment executes.</div></details>",
    "note": "让一半学生追踪 A、一半追踪 B，再互相解释。两个程序都能按顺序运行，但计算 total 时的 price 不同。A 中改 price 不会自动重新计算已经存入的 total；这再次检验赋值复制当前值的概念。不要总结成所有语句交换都影响结果，只有分析数据依赖才能判断。这里只入门比较两种顺序，不宣称完整覆盖 Topic 3.9。"
  },
  {
    "title": "New requirement: a fee per order",
    "tag": "MODIFY THE DESIGN",
    "time": "66–70 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.M.1 · Skill 2.B",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">Keep the price at 12 per ticket. Add a booking fee of <strong>3 once per order</strong>.</p><p><strong>A.</strong> <span class=\"mono\">tickets * price + fee</span></p><p><strong>B.</strong> <span class=\"mono\">tickets * (price + fee)</span></p><details><summary>Choose an expression and justify it</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>A.</strong> Add the fee once after calculating the ticket subtotal. B would charge the fee for every ticket.</div></details><p class=\"small\">The valid ticket range remains 1–50.</p>",
    "note": "先读准业务要求一次订单收 3，而不是每张票收 3。让学生用两张票验证：正确为 24+3=27，错误表达式为 2×15=30。单张票两式都得到 15，说明一次运行一致并不能排除所有逻辑错误。这是下一课系统测试、错误修正的入口，本课先保留具体的反例思维。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Modify, then explain your changes",
    "tag": "STUDENT BUILD · ORIGINAL TASK",
    "time": "70–76 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.M.1 · AAP-1.A / B",
    "html": "<ol><li>Add a meaningful variable for the fee.</li><li>Update the calculation; keep one final output.</li><li>Predict the result for <strong>2 tickets</strong>, then run.</li></ol><details><summary>Show one possible solution</summary><div class=\"answer\"><pre class=\"mono\" style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.35\">tickets ← INPUT()\nprice ← 12\nfee ← 3\ntotal ← tickets * price + fee\nDISPLAY(total)</pre><p>Input 2 → output <strong>27</strong>.</p></div></details><p class=\"small\">Use numeric INPUT and the same variable names consistently.</p>",
    "note": "给三分钟独立修改或结对实现，一分钟运行核对，两分钟分享解释。先隐藏示例，让学生真正写代码。接受把 fee 放在 price 前面等正确的独立初始化顺序，只要使用变量之前已经赋值。也接受先求 subtotal 再求 total 的可读实现。若把 fee 加在 DISPLAY 后，追问输出发生时它是否已计入；不要直接替学生改好。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Check the modified behavior",
    "tag": "COMPARE EXPECTED AND ACTUAL",
    "time": "76–80 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J.1 / J.3 · Skill 4.C",
    "html": "<p>Requirement: <span class=\"mono\">total = tickets × 12 + 3</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Input</th><th>Expected output</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>15</td><td>12 + 3</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>27</td><td>24 + 3</td></tr><tr><td>50</td><td>603</td><td>600 + 3</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"callout\">Run each case separately. If actual output differs, trace the first mismatch.</p><p class=\"small\">Passing a few cases is useful evidence; it is not a general proof of correctness.</p>",
    "note": "学生把实际结果并排写在纸上，不只是口头说成功。选择 2 可暴露按票收费的错误，1 与 50 是本任务合法范围两端。输入验证留到后续，当前代码尚不拒绝 0、51 或小数。若发现不一致，按输入、初始化、表达式、输出的顺序定位第一处偏离；下一课会系统讲测试和错误类型。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Explain the program in English",
    "tag": "COMMUNICATE UNDERSTANDING",
    "time": "80–83 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.A / B / C / D",
    "html": "<p>Describe the modified calculator to someone who cannot see its code.</p><ul><li>What is its purpose?</li><li>What input does it receive?</li><li>How does it calculate the displayed output?</li></ul><details><summary>Show a model explanation</summary><div class=\"answer\">The program helps a buyer find an order’s cost. It receives a ticket count, multiplies it by 12, adds one booking fee of 3 and displays the total.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Use the requirement to explain the meaning of the arithmetic.</p>",
    "note": "让每对学生先口头表达，再写一段英文，不要求机械背诵示例。检查是否把目的、输入、处理与输出连起来，尤其明确 fee 每订单一次。不要把课堂说明题称作官方 Create 书面回答题；它只是培养后续能解释自己程序的基础能力。对英语表达较弱者给 receive、multiply、add、display 四个动词支架。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Homework and the next lesson",
    "tag": "CONSOLIDATE",
    "time": "83–85 min",
    "code": "12 original questions · 30 classroom marks",
    "html": "<p><strong>Homework:</strong> 6 multiple-choice + 6 written questions.</p><p>Allow about <strong>40 minutes</strong>. Select exactly <strong>two</strong> answers for Q5.</p><p class=\"callout\">Predict on paper before using the lab. For a trace, retain the value after every relevant assignment.</p><p><strong>Next:</strong> use requirements, tests and debugging to improve the ticket calculator.</p><p class=\"small\">All tasks are original practice. Written questions are classroom exercises, not official AP FRQs.</p>",
    "note": "说明作业页可在线查看、展开解析，也有可打印学生卷与独立答案卷。Q5 必须两项全对且无多选才得 1 分；六道书面题每题四分，按步骤和解释给分。建议先独立完成再核对答案，把错误分类为赋值、顺序、运算顺序或输入输出。提醒教师保留学生修改的代码与测试记录，下一课继续使用。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket: trace and transfer",
    "tag": "EXIT TICKET · ORIGINAL PRACTICE",
    "time": "85–90 min",
    "code": "Four checks · Individual work",
    "html": "<p><strong>1.</strong> <span class=\"mono\">a ← 4; b ← a; a ← a + 3</span>. Final <span class=\"mono\">b</span>?</p><p><strong>2.</strong> Evaluate <span class=\"mono\">2 + 3 * 4</span>.</p><p><strong>3.</strong> At 12 per ticket plus one fee of 3, what is the total for 2 tickets?</p><p><strong>4.</strong> Why must the total be calculated before it is displayed?</p><details><summary>Show answers</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>1.</strong> 4. <strong>2.</strong> 14. <strong>3.</strong> 27.<br><strong>4.</strong> DISPLAY needs the calculated value; later assignment does not change an earlier output.</div></details><p class=\"small\">Semicolons separate written steps here; put each statement on its own line in the lab.</p>",
    "note": "给三分钟独立作答，一分钟同桌核对，一分钟收集错因。每项一分，建议达到三分且第 1 题赋值复制正确后进入下一课；这是课堂诊断建议，不是 AP 官方评分。第 1 题若答 7，回到复制当前值例；第 2 题若答 20，补括号和优先级；第 3 题若答 30，重读每订单一次；第 4 题需要具体说明先计算后使用。"
  }
]
